# II. The Sidebar (The "Spine" of the Product)

## Top Placement
- Place a **profile/management block** at the top (admin email + chevron indicating clickable).
- Profile popover: sign-out, language toggle, account actions.

## Link Design
- Every navigation link must have a **recognizable icon** and a **short title**.
- This enables seamless sidebar collapse and room for notification badges or "New" chips.

## Reducing Cognitive Load
- **Group links by relevant categories**: Overview, Catalog, Sales, Insights.
- **Push rarely used items** (Settings, Help) to the bottom of the sidebar.

## Scalability
- As links expand, nest them inside **click-to-expand dropdowns** within the sidebar (`SidebarNavDropdown`).

## Active States
- Include an active state for the current page.
- Use a **vertical rectangle indicator** on the left of the active link — not a full filled background.
- Pair with a subtle background tint only.

## Empty Space Utilization
- Use empty sidebar space for **global search** (`AdminSearchBar`), integrations, or activity highlights.
- Integrate search below nav groups (Linear/Dub pattern).

## Implementation
- Edit `app/admin/components/AdminSidebar.tsx`.
- Keep collapsible behavior (64px / 256px) with icon+label pattern.
